    ],
    "note_verbatim": "R. B. Joshi (Bombay) is a well-known Marathi travelogue writer. He has also published short stories. His article Off the Road in Berar appeared in the Marathi Literature Special issue of Quest.",
    "note_printed_page": 17,
    "nationality_evidence": "(Bombay)",
