    ],
    "note_verbatim": "M. S. Kalyanasundaram was born in Madura in 1901. Started writing in Tamil in 1928. Won a prize for his story Abdul Qudir which was published in the well-known Tamil weekly Ananda Viketan. The Message first appeared in the same journal in 1934 and later in Munshi Premchand's Hans in a Hindi translation by the author.",
    "note_printed_page": 17,
    "nationality_evidence": "was born in Madura in 1901",
    "vocation_evidence": "Started writing in Tamil in 1928. Won a prize for his story Abdul Qudir",
