    "note_verbatim": "A. K. Ramanujan is a lecturer in English literature at Lingaraj College, Belgaum. Most of his literary work is in Kannada but he has had a poem accepted by Poetry London-New York and is now at work on a doctoral thesis on 'Myth and Symbol in W. B. Yeats.' Two of his articles have appeared in the Southern Folklore Quarterly, University of Florida, U.S.A. He is 28.",
